  m_text: '"Alex... you''ve finally made it.


    This is where Sabrina''s story
    ends... or perhaps where yours begins.


    The room is silent, the lights are
    dead, and something is waiting in the darkness.


    Explore your surroundings.
    Find a way to restore the power.


    But be careful, Alex... you''re not alone
    in here.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
