      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '"After everything he discovered, Alex finally understands what happened
    to Sabrina.


    The three symbols have destroyed the mechanism sustaining the
    curse.


    Sabrina is finally free, and the school is no longer haunted.


    As
    the first light of dawn appears, Alex finally escapes."'
